\pard\sa200\f0\fs22 With a three-layer beat in place, small changes produce large effects. Try these variations:\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa100\f0\fs22 \bullet  Switch between sixteenth-note and eighth-note hi-hats on the same kick/snare pattern. Feel the difference in energy and density.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sa100\f0\fs22 \bullet  Try removing hi-hats on the same steps as the kick. This creates "space" and makes the kick more prominent \u8212? a technique common in hip-hop.\par
